A Friend of DNA

--> A digital guide for PCR experiments
-- Doing PCR - Need to design the correct primers 
1. GC CONTENT Melting Temperature
2. or using Primer3 (well-optmized primer sets)

It is a bioinformatics tool - that helps us to design primers for PCR experiments.

Advantage : 
1. Suggests Primer atumatically
2. Check GC Content, Tm, dimers, hairpins
3. Saves time & reduce errors.

